# MASTER WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — BAMARLA VILLAGE DIGITAL PORTAL

## 1. Project Overview

Create a complete, professional, multi-page Hindi-language village information portal for **Bamarla Village, Barmer, Rajasthan, India**.

Website Name: **बामरला ग्राम डिजिटल पोर्टल**

English Name: Bamarla Village – Barmer

Location: Bamarla, Sedwa region, Barmer, Rajasthan, India  
PIN Code: 344704

This website is being developed as a public-interest digital initiative by **Vikash Kumar**, who is currently contributing his own time and resources to make village-related information accessible to residents.

The portal must help villagers find public information about local governance, elected representatives, government schemes, schools, banks, health services, development projects, public notices, village contributors and grievance-support channels.

Build a real, functional, responsive website — not just a landing-page mockup.

**Important:** This is an independent village information portal, not an officially authorized government website. Never falsely claim government ownership, approval, funding or affiliation.

